      "message": "Thinking about it, this implementation of `hasNext` is wrong, as we will tell that we have an element event if it\u0027s the `sCompletedIndicator`\n\nSo this means that if the queue is empty, `hasNext` needs to wait to know if it\u0027s an element or the end of the stream.",
